			"notes": "- Compatible with Vanilla Tweaks' armored elytra format\n  - Renders the chestplate of Vanilla Tweaks armored elytra (on any server with the datapack)\n  - Can save armored elytra in this format (the default)\n    - Change this with `/metalwings storageMode [CUSTOM_DATA|BUNDLE_CONTENTS]` in game (op or singleplayer required)\n    - When upgrading from 1.0.0 you'll probably want to set it to custom data\n  - Note that Vanilla Tweaks can't handle modded elytra or chestplates (the format will still work fine)\n- Prevent nesting armored elytra\n- Support 1.20.6\n- Separate armored elytra when the item entity takes damage\n  - For example, this means that netherite chestplates will survive when the elytra is dropped in lava\n- Fix attribute modifiers not copying from chestplates when making armored elytra\n- Should work with most modded elytra\n- Requires fabric loader at least 0.16.7\n\nSpecial thanks to [CraftyCorvid](https://github.com/craftycorvid) for a lot of these changes"
		},
